      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ANOTHER NEPHEW (1) looks ideally placed to bounce back after finishing fourth over 2100m at Newman last time. He battled on well after being prominent on the turn, and this more suitable assignment should see him going close to winning. AWESOME LILY (3) was safely held when out of the money over 1600m here last time but had started at $6.50 and is better than that effort suggests. Each-way claims in this. BIG SHOTS (2) was disappointing when caught wide over 1400m here after winning at Broome before that. He has a big swing in his draw this time and has every chance to turn things around. FRIES WITH THAT (4) has hit a rich vein of form, finishing third two starts ago before scoring by a long neck over 1600m here. He looks capable of going right on with it. MR HOLLYWOOD (6) is another worth including and has enough ability to give this a shake.",
